With this in mind, you are tasked to prove the following target statement.

Target Problem (your task):

\begin{lemma}
If $C$ is a minimal $\Tilde{f}$-violating cycle in $\widetilde{G}(S)$, then $\vol(S \Delta C) \geq 2 \cdot \vol(S)$.
\end{lemma}

